OSI_NOTE = ("Most fieldbuses use a collapsed three-layer stack: physical (1), data link (2) and application (7). "
            "Anything they need from layers 3-6 (segmentation, routing between lines) is folded into those. Internet "
            "protocols use the full TCP/IP stack and leave layers 5 and 6 to the application.")

